	(text "Forming a PI-filter with the 2x10uF output caps, a ferrite bead, and 100nF cap. \n\nFB => Imax >= 5(Iout) = 5(80mA) = 400mA\nDCR < 0.5 and > 0.1\n\nSelecting 300mA rated 520moHm DCR FB. \n\n\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
